.MODEL DBAT54 D ( IS=2.117E-07 N=1.016 BV=36 IBV=1.196E-06 RS=2.637
+ CJO=1.114E-11 VJ=0.2013 M=0.3868 FC=0 TT=0 EG=0.69 XTI=2 )
